{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39524","headline":"赠李司徒 · 张蠙","name":"赠李司徒","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"承家拓定陇关西，勳贵名应上将齐。\n金库夜开龙甲冷，玉堂秋闭凤笙低。\n欢筵每恕娇娥醉，闲枥犹惊战马嘶。\n长怪鲁儒头枉白，不亲弓劒觅丹梯。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张蠙","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_39524.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39524","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}